{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "7f03e5c9d4b6720a75583907bc9ef387938f50b7e07391a609688430f12b7d31", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまですー。\nたこ焼きの差し入れ持ってきたんで、食べてください♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦——\n我带了些章鱼烧过来慰劳大家，请吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1001_null", "source_sha256": "f8c67fdf6c0d75ee7086cfced6952aff8ceaaaa173d2db15ada57080adcaaf38", "ja": "次の日……", "zh": "第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "7b271705c080ddc23b84b53d2b37749170c6410dfb3321711db38b36f0bc501e", "ja": "新作たこ焼き『超大玉』持ってきましたー！\nめっちゃ買うてきたんで、おすそわけですー♪", "zh": "我带来新出的章鱼烧“超大号”啦——！\n买了超多，分给大家一起吃哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1003_null", "source_sha256": "f8c67fdf6c0d75ee7086cfced6952aff8ceaaaa173d2db15ada57080adcaaf38", "ja": "次の日……", "zh": "第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "b78ea1f6dbf635236e17fd05951ceb0ee33d1f2411c15528bf3293ac3a3e0be3", "ja": "あ、いたいた。{$P$}さん。\nお腹空いてません？　実は、ええもんがありまして……", "zh": "啊，在这儿呢。{$P$}先生。\n肚子饿不饿？其实啊，我这儿有样好东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1005_p", "source_sha256": "17da281efe855b7aca7d4ba0bfe028a702700342f48b4c87b3b68e75b1da5f14", "ja": "ストップ！　奈緒、一応聞くけど……\nたこ焼きの差し入れか？", "zh": "等等！奈绪，我姑且问一下……\n该不会是送来的章鱼烧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "531bbb3b6e45c5ad40c34d046524df7185ce6805beeedd6b70398f2e19afb389", "ja": "ええっ！？　なんで分かったんですか？\n{$P$}さん、エスパーですか？？", "zh": "诶诶！？你怎么知道的？\n{$P$}先生，难道你是超能力者吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e399127972e2b3bb525b1682256d4057da7b2915f4167764f99563b98e52ba4b", "ja": "いや、分かるよ。\nここのところ毎日じゃないか。", "zh": "不，当然看得出来啊。\n最近不是每天都在吃吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "d22706465cfef8f5f4993cb6538f55e70b16e7e8523b99fe2c66d5bde3faa7c3", "ja": "えへへ。でも、ここのたこ焼き、めっちゃおいしい\nですよね？　え、おいしくないです？", "zh": "嘿嘿。不过，这里的章鱼烧真的特别好吃，对吧？咦，不好吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8b116b5b10b63c1c18d856ab5e6631486bd1151501f26bf4033a1b18f8243fb7", "ja": "おいしいけど、それでも連日はさすがに……\nお金も馬鹿にならないんじゃないか？", "zh": "虽然好吃，但也不能连续好几天都吃吧……\n花销也不小吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "f135c918bed80926198e3d46ef38c806d62b921304daab5120cb4b34e9ccce3b", "ja": "あはは、野暮なこと言わんといてください。\nそんなんは必要経費っちゅーもんです。", "zh": "哈哈，别说这种扫兴的话嘛。\n这就叫必要经费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1011_p", "source_sha256": "95cc924efcfcf6c738d97186fa24c4bb04b1f9a2fc9c5a393ace354bf40c06c5", "ja": "必要なのか？　まぁ、本人がいいならいいけど。\nでも、どうして急にこんなにたこ焼きを？", "zh": "这算必要吗？嘛，本人觉得没问题倒也无所谓。\n不过，怎么突然买这么多章鱼烧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "88586d663cc288ebc8a8244eb3110545505700c0d25292c3153b7b624d40f21c", "ja": "いやー、私もこないだの公演で、\n亜利沙に気づかされまして。", "zh": "哎呀～我也在上次公演的时候，\n被亚利沙点醒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "7c3ba48691738e0d98c476f9d17c7cf753f137d5b2126649ac699463b9d61c56", "ja": "いつも何気なく食べてたたこ焼きも、\n永遠や無いんやな。って……。", "zh": "平时普普通通吃着的章鱼烧，\n也不是永远都在的啊。我是这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1014_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "ac4eca75610310f5017221dbec810bb867cfe0679bf3d5bba17434756a1c7144", "ja": "ほら、亜利沙が推しアイドルの卒業で、\nめっちゃ落ち込んでましたやん。", "zh": "你看，亚利沙因为自己支持的偶像毕业，消沉得不得了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "25037073cc5f272b293eba1dd0b855c8c45f218f60be43c0d1863456f80bda24", "ja": "そん時、前から亜利沙がよう言うてた、「推しは\n推せるときに推せ」の意味が分かった気ぃしたんです。", "zh": "那时候，我好像明白了亚利沙之前总挂在嘴边的那句话——“喜欢的偶像，就要在还能支持的时候尽情支持”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e8f2c82e0bdb2232395f6489b91ae024b35ee1396bfa099d3fe1616e1c1332ae", "ja": "…………なるほど？\nその結果が、この連日のたこ焼きラッシュか。", "zh": "……原来如此？\n所以结果就是这几天接连不断的章鱼烧攻势吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "6deca16e1f09fd4a35b3e65e15e1d84fd7e58871b4fbc86d3072241cff5c57f9", "ja": "そうなんです！　私が売り上げに貢献せんと、\nあの店が無くなってしまうかもしれへん！", "zh": "就是这样！要是我不为营业额出点力，那家店说不定就要关门了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0503_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "a87571ef09d69d3c55666d0c87fa2fdc80fcf9a85a4acfb6347cc6071b0aa5ca", "ja": "「そんなことにはさせません！」てことで、な？\n{$P$}さんもご協力お願いしますね♪", "zh": "“绝不能让那种事情发生！”就是这么回事，懂了吧？\n{$P$}先生也要来帮忙哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
